OL,5,G1300 Classical Live
OL,6,     FElizabeth Alker showcases the best
OL,7,     Fperformances from the UK and
OL,8,     Fbeyond, including the BBC
OL,9,     FPhilharmonic playing Sibelius's
OL,10,     FKarelia Suite.
OL,11,G1600 Composer of the Week: Verdi
OL,12,     F4/5. Kate Molleson explores
OL,13,     FVerdi's battles with authority and
OL,14,     Fsocietal expectations.
OL,15,G1700 In Tune
OL,16,     FClassical guitarist Tohi Harada
OL,17,     Fplays live. Mark Simpson and
OL,18,     FTamara Stefanovich chat to Petroc
OL,19,     Fabout the world premiere of Mark's
OL,20,     Fpiano concerto.
